{"originalText":"form","normalizedText":"A Customer is inquiring about the Formstack platform, specifically regarding the configuration and management of forms. They are likely seeking assistance with form setup, submission handling, or integration features available within the Formstack ecosystem. This inquiry may involve understanding how to effectively utilize the Form Builder, manage submissions, or implement integrations such as Webhooks and Submit Actions to enhance their form functionality.","aiTechnicalObservation":"The inquiry pertains to the Formstack platform's capabilities in managing forms and submissions. Key components involved include the Form Builder for creating and configuring forms, the submission process which involves capturing user input and triggering Submit Actions, and the integration of Webhooks for real-time data handling. Potential issues could arise from misconfigurations in the form settings, submission limits, or integration endpoints. Troubleshooting may involve checking the logs for submission events, ensuring that the form is set to store submissions, and verifying that any configured integrations are correctly set up to handle the data being submitted. The Submit Actions can be either blocking or queued, affecting how they interact with the submission process. If the customer is experiencing issues with Submit Actions, it is essential to determine whether they are configured to run inline (blocking) or asynchronously (queued), as this can impact the user experience and data processing flow.","chunks":[{"index":0,"chunk_text":"A Customer is inquiring about the Formstack platform, specifically regarding the configuration and management of forms. They are likely seeking assistance with form setup, submission handling, or integration features available within the Formstack ecosystem. This inquiry may involve understanding how to effectively utilize the Form Builder, manage submissions, or implement integrations such as Webhooks and Submit Actions to enhance their form functionality.","chunk_embedding":[0.026249796,0.014292952,0.014657184,0.0048857275,-0.009513982,-0.010612956,0.00047295162,0.03908582,0.034112178,0.007542107,0.009601899,-0.023838332,-0.01872653,-0.017910149,0.0145190265,0.05566464,0.043356124,-0.031198323,-0.016716976,0.016616499,0.078473076,0.010600396,-0.006364634,0.01607643,-0.02609908,0.01782223,-0.03230358,0.008496645,-0.047274753,-0.010550157,0.027053619,-0.027631365,-0.046496052,0.014481347,0.018387418,0.022444203,0.030067949,0.010782512,0.004138425,0.03519231,-0.03144952,0.026802424,-0.035820298,0.00829569,0.025571572,0.057272285,-0.029063173,0.007981696,-0.018399978,0.03571982,-0.012151521,-0.0010715004,0.023599697,-0.0033785624,0.033308353,0.020233694,-0.015260049,-0.0023282566,-0.03260501,0.055915836,0.0060129617,-0.025772527,-0.030645696,-0.0017269603,-0.012120121,0.01954291,-0.0060600606,0.03172583,-0.05692061,0.05616703,0.018199021,-0.04004036,0.019618269,-0.010744833,0.020409532,-0.006738285,0.054509148,0.045817826,-0.057222046,0.004527776,-0.013740324,-0.042577423,-0.023662496,-0.017520797,-0.014644624,0.013589608,0.003265525,0.023285706,-0.03953797,-0.029289247,-0.023750415,0.0012685308,0.023310825,0.071690835,0.03617197,-0.049836934,0.009815414,-0.024993826,-0.019015403,0.02483055,0.052047443,-0.03953797,-0.042803496,-0.024441198,0.04697332,-0.022419086,-0.03305716,0.01743288,0.027103856,-0.039713807,-0.07400182,-0.0016704416,-0.017206805,0.011705651,-0.036272448,0.03870903,-0.03278085,-0.0048480486,-0.028962694,-0.009413504,-0.0002847522,0.022946592,-0.017495679,0.030545218,-0.0011107494,-0.031173203,-0.032027263,0.032102622,-0.064205244,-0.037654016,-0.020635605,-0.008917395,0.07993,-0.029540442,-0.011711931,-0.05254983,-0.011963125,0.0033314636,-0.03873415,-0.015184691,0.0048197894,-0.02396393,-0.0021649802,0.03772937,-0.03265525,-0.008421286,-0.026023721,0.010047769,-0.026752185,-0.0037333742,0.016892811,0.005523133,-0.030319143,-0.021163113,-0.0007300332,-0